        "quote": "On March 7, 2010, at approximately 8:00 p.m., the plaintiff allegedly sustained personal injuries when she fell down an interior stairway in a two-family house that was owned by Sheila Robinson and in which the plaintiff had rented the upstairs apartment for more than 20 years.",
